B0997\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"--_000_CY4PR17MB11269ABB1E06A1E1A818BC8FBC540CY4PR17MB1126namp_\\r\\n\",\"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=\\\"us-ascii\\\"\\r\\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"Is Solitaire a new code name for our next gen environment?\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom: Bud Stoll\\r\\nSent: Wednesday, July 25, 2018 8:26 PM\\r\\nTo: Peat Cerf <pcerf@froth.ly>; Billy Tun <btun@froth.ly>; Mallory Kraeusen=\\r\\n <mkraeusen@froth.ly>; allhands <allhands@froth.ly>\\r\\nSubject: RE: Craft Brewer Conference\\r\\n\\r\\nSolitaire runs pretty well...\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom: Peat Cerf\\r\\nSent: Wednesday, July 25, 2018 8:24 PM\\r\\nTo: Billy Tun <btun@froth.ly<mailto:btun@froth.ly>>; Mallory Kraeusen <mkra=\\r\\neusen@froth.ly<mailto:mkraeusen@froth.ly>>; allhands <allhands@froth.ly<mai=\\r\\nlto:allhands@froth.ly>>; Bud Stoll <bstoll@froth.ly<mailto:bstoll@froth.ly>=\\r\\n>\\r\\nSubject: RE: Craft Brewer Conference\\r\\n\\r\\nIts as slow as our outlook... @Bud<mailto:bstoll@froth.ly> when are we gonn=\\r\\na get new boxes?\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom: Billy Tun\\r\\nSent: Wednesday, July 25, 2018 8:23 PM\\r\\nTo: Peat Cerf <pcerf@froth.ly<mailto:pcerf@froth.ly>>; Mallory Kraeusen <mk=\\r\\nraeusen@froth.ly<mailto:mkraeusen@froth.ly>>; allhands <allhands@froth.ly<m=\\r\\nailto:allhands@froth.ly>>\\r\\nSubject: RE: Craft Brewer Conference\\r\\n\\r\\nIf only we had some sort of web forum where we could easily discuss this to=\\r\\npic....\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom: Peat Cerf\\r\\nSent: Wednesday, July 25, 2018 8:16 PM\\r\\nTo: Mallory Kraeusen <mkraeusen@froth.ly<mailto:mkraeusen@froth.ly>>; Billy=\\r\\n Tun <btun@froth.ly<mailto:btun@froth.ly>>; allhands <allhands@froth.ly<mai=\\r\\nlto:allhands@froth.ly>>\\r\\nSubject: RE: Craft Brewer Conference\\r\\n\\r\\nUNSUBSCRIBE\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom: Mallory Kraeusen\\r\\nSent: Wednesday, July 25, 2018 8:15 PM\\r\\nTo: Billy Tun <btun@froth.ly<mailto:btun@froth.ly>>; allhands <allhands@fro=\\r\\nth.ly<mailto:allhands@froth.ly>>\\r\\nSubject: RE: Craft Brewer Conference\\r\\n\\r\\nSo glad we don't have those fidget spinners anymore. They are soooooo playe=\\r\\nd out.\\r\\n\\r\\n-M\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom: Billy Tun\\r\\nSent: Wednesday, July 25, 2018 8:10 PM\\r\\nTo: allhands <allhands@froth.ly<mailto:allhands@froth.ly>>\\r\\nSubject: RE: Craft Brewer Conference\\r\\n\\r\\nAlso, please start thinking about themes for our sponsor booth. We have sec=\\r\\nured budget for custom stickers and shirts - now we just need something new=\\r\\n and clever to put on them.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom: Billy Tun\\r\\nSent: Wednesday, July 25, 2018 8:08 PM\\r\\nTo: allhands <allhands@froth.ly<mailto:allhands@froth.ly>>\\r\\nSubject: Craft Brewer Conference\\r\\n\\r\\nHey folks,\\r\\n\\r\\nAs discussed in last weeks' team meeting, go ahead and book travel to the C=\\r\\nraft Brewer Conf. We'll setup and send out information on team building eve=\\r\\nnts as the event draws nearer.\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://www.craftbrewersconference.com\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n--_000_CY4PR17MB11269ABB1E06A1E1A818BC8FBC540CY4PR17MB1126namp_\\r\\n\",\"Content-Type: text/html; charset=\\\"us-ascii\\\"\\r\\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"<html xmlns:v=3D\\\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\\\" xmlns:o=3D\\\"urn:schemas-micr=\\r\\nosoft-com:office:office\\\" xmlns:w=3D\\\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\\\" =\\r\\nxmlns:m=3D\\\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/2004/12/omml\\\" xmlns=3D\\\"http:=\\r\\n//www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40\\\">\\r\\n<head>\\r\\n<meta http-equiv=3D\\\"Content-Type\\\" content=3D\\\"text/html; charset=3Dus-ascii\\\"=\\r\\n>\\r\\n<meta name=3D\\\"Generator\\\" content=3D\\\"Microsoft Word 15 (filtered medium)\\\">\\r\\n<style><!--\\r\\n/* Font Definitions */\\r\\n@font-face\\r\\n\\t{font-family:\\\"Cambria Math\\\";\\r\\n\\tpanose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;}\\r\\n@font-face\\r\\n\\t{font-family:Calibri;\\r\\n\\tpanose-1:2 15 5 2 2 2 4 3 2 4;}\\r\\n@font-face\\r\\n\\t{font-family:\\\"Calibri Light\\\";\\r\\n\\tpanose-1:2 15 3 2 2